<title>FRANCE: Skis Rossignol first-half turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Skis Rossignol first-half turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>    (All figures in millions of French francs)	   pct chge</p>
<p>    Turnover			1,208.91   vs 1,140.14     + 6.03</p>
<p>	-- winter sports	  1,087.83   vs 1,060.01     + 2.62</p>
<p>	-- other activity	   121.08   vs    80.13     +51.08</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the results in a statement. It said first half turnover confirms full year 1996-97 turnover increase forecasts.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
